      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{i\\hbar\\frac{d}{d\\kt}|\\kpsi\\rangle} = \\mk{R}{\\kHeff|\\kpsi\\rangle}",
      "src": "(6.9)",
      "uses": []
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{i\\frac{d}{d\\kt}|\\kpsi\\rangle} = \\mk{R}{\\left(\\kDelta|2\\rangle\\langle 2| - \\frac{i\\kgamma}{2}\\hat{c}^\\dagger\\hat{c}\\right)|\\kpsi\\rangle}",
       "uses": [
        0
       ],
       "cap": "在$\\hbar = 1$的单位中，(6.24) 即是以此写出的。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{i\\frac{d}{d\\kt}|\\kpsi\\rangle} = \\mk{R}{\\left(\\kDelta - \\frac{i\\kgamma}{2}\\right)|2\\rangle\\langle 2|\\kpsi\\rangle}",
       "uses": [
        1
       ],
       "cap": "$\\hat{c}^\\dagger\\hat{c} = |2\\rangle\\langle 2|$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\frac{d}{d\\kt}|\\kpsi\\rangle} = \\mk{R}{-\\left(\\frac{\\kgamma}{2} + i\\kDelta\\right)|2\\rangle\\langle 2|\\kpsi\\rangle}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "除以$i$：$-i(\\Delta - i\\gamma/2) = -(\\gamma/2 + i\\Delta)$。"
      }
     ],
     "num": "(6.25)",
     "note": "书中把右边印成$-\\left(\\frac{\\kgamma}{2} + i\\kDelta\\right)|2\\rangle$，没有写出它所作用的概率幅$\\langle 2|\\kpsi\\rangle$，并把 (6.24) 印成带$+\\frac{i\\kgamma}{2}\\hat{c}^\\dagger\\hat{c}$；(6.7) 的负号才使$|2\\rangle$的概率幅衰变。"
